    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n897" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγριό-της</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>savageness, wildness</i>, of animals, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμερότης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.2.7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				12.163
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				588a21
			</span></i>; ofplants, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.2.4
			</span></i>; of untilled ground, 
